    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūgwa kwa Yelusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna aho lwashika lūshikū lw'ikūmi ū mu ng'weji gw'ikūmi, ū Zedekia alī mu ng'waka gwakwe gwa kenda alī ntemi, ū Nebukadineza ntemi wa Babuloni wiza nalyo pyī ī libità lyakwe ī lyose kūgūdumīla ū nzengo gwa Yelusalemu. Ūzenga ng'hambī ī hanze yago ūgūpīndīlīja mabità ga bashilikale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gūpīndīlījiwa mabità gīko kūshisha ng'waka gw'ikūmi na gūmò go ng'wa Zedekia alī ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho gwashika ng'weji gwa kanè ī nzala yūdidoha no ū mu nzengo, a banhū būmala gete ī shilīwa sha kūlya. Lūshikū lwa kenda ū mu ngweji gwenūyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ndugu ya nzengo yūkambūlwa ipandī ilebe mu makanza ga būjikū, pyī ī libità lya bashilikale lyūtoloka kūbītīla ha mita gwalīho bbihī na ngūnda gwa ntemi; būbīta ha gatī gatī ya ndugu būbīlī wajo, nūūlū īkī a bashilikale ba Bakalidayo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bakalidayo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "A banhu ba Babuloni biitanagwa gīko; kwandīja haaha a banhu ba Babuloni bakwitanwa Bakalidayo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " baalī bagūpīndīlīgije ū nzengo; a batoloki būpeela balolile kwitogolo lya Alaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bashilikale ba Bakalidayo būbakūūbīja, ū ntemi būmpandīkīla mu mbūga ya Yeliko, a bashilikale bakwe bamalaga kūneka būsambaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū wei ūding'wa, ūtwalwa Libula ūko walī ū ntemi wa Babuloni; ī likanza lyenīlo ū Zedekia ūhamīlwa kūpandīka nsango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja bakwe būbabūlaga mu būtongi wakwe alolile; hanuma ya henaho ū wei būgakobola a miso gakwe, hūna būntunga nhendele ja shaba būntwala Babuloni atungilwe gīko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūkenaagūlwa kwa Yelusalemu na hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ng'waka gw'ikūmi na kenda gwa būsugi bo ng'wa Nebukadineza ntemi wa Babuloni, Nebuzaladani ūyo walī ntaale wa balang'hani ba ntemi, na ntūmami wa ha sīlīlī ya ntemi wa Babuloni, akingīla ī Yelusalemu mu lūshikū lwa mpungatī ng'weji gwa katanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūshika wīpemba moto ī hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA, nī likūlū, nī numba ja Yelusalemu pyī ī jose; pyī ī numba ī nhengeke ūjipemba moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī a bashilikale ba Bakalidayo abo walī nabo ū ntaale wa balang'hani ba ntemi būjiikīja hasī, pyī ī ndugu ja ngītīli īyo yalī īgūpīndije ū nzengo gwa Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Nebuzaladani ū ntaale wa balang'hani ba ntemi, ūbasola a banhū abo baalī basaaga ū mu nzengo, na a bangī abo baalī basaagīīla ū mu sī, ūūkababītīla na a babo baalī baaja boi benekīlī ū kūlī ntemi wa Babuloni, kūbasaamya ūbatwala mu būding'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ntaale wa bashilikale akabaleka bamò ba bakuunese ba bakuunese, babize batūmami ba mu migūnda ya mizabibu, nū mu a malaale a gangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Bakalidayo būshibelagūla ī shikolo sha shaba īsho shalī ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA; gītī, ng'hīngī ja shaba, makīndīkīlo, shiseme",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shiseme:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shiseme sha kūtūūlīla minzī; shalī shiseme shitaale shitanagwa nyanza:",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " sha kūtūūlīla minzī; ī shaba pyī ī yose būbūūcha būjana Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakajaana na shikolo gītī, mafulīla, makolelo, majimījo ga tala, nzweso, nī shiseme sha shaba pyī īsho shatūmamīlagwa mu myatīla ya kalamīje ka mu hekalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale wa balang'hani ba ntemi akajisola nī nzweso ja kūzuukīlīgīja būbbani, na a mabbakuli ga kūseeseebelela; pyī ī shiseme īsho shalī sha zahabu na sha feza ūshijana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shaba yalī ningī no īyo bakīnja a ha ng'hīngī īj'ibīlī, na a ha shiseme sha kūtūūlīla minzī, na a ha makīndīkīlo; yalī shilambu ū kūbūmana ū būdito wayo. Ī shikolo shenīsho Solomoni walī washibeeja kūlwa nguno ya hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī ng'hīngī yalī na būlīhu bo fuuti makūmi abīlī na mpungatī, na yalī n'ikundīkījo lya shaba a higūlya, lya būlīhu bo fuuti inè na nusu; hūna lyūtūūlīlwa kalweyo ka būlenji, na makomamanga ga shaba gūpīndīlījiwa. Ī ng'hīngī jose būbīlī wajo jalī na būlenji bo mbika īmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale wa mabità ga ntemi ūnsola nū Selaya ū ngabīji ntaale, nū Sefania ūyo walī wa ha sīlīlī yakwe, hamò na a balang'hani būdatū wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu banhū abo akabasola abo baalī bashiiga ū mu nzengo, walīmo ū ntaale wa kahelele ka banhū ba būlūgū, na banhū batanò, abo baalī bagunanhi ba ntemi mu mihayo ya būsugi. Nū ng'wandīki ūyo walī ntaale wa kahelele ka milīmo ū mu sī; ūsolwa na banhū bakwe makūmi atandatū abo baalī basaagīīla ū mu nzengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Nebuzaladani ū ntaale wa balang'hani ba ntemi ūbasola pye a benabo, ūja nabo Libula kūlī ntemi wa Babuloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wabashisha ī Libula būhamīlwa nsango gwa kūbūlagwa; būbūlagīlwa kwenūko mu sī ya Hamasi. Na lūūlū a banhū ba Yuda bīnjiwa, būbiza basaamiwa ū mu sī yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gedalia kūtūūlwa būsugi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Babuloni ū Nebukadineza ūnsola Gedalia ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ahikamu, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Shafani, ūntūūla kūbiza nsugi wabo a banhū abo bakalekeelwa ū mu sī ya Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bataale ba bashilikale na a banhū babo aho bigwa gīkī ū ntemi wa Babuloni wantūūlile Gedalia a ha būsugi, biza hamò na banhū babo ī Misipa ūko walī ū Gedalia, baalī ba Ishimaeli ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nesania, Yohanani ng'witūnja o ng'wa Kalea, Selaya ng'witūnja o ng'wa Tanhumeti, munhū wa Netofa, Jaazania muna Maaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gedalia ūbilahīlīla balī hamò na a banhū babo, ūbatimbya ng'holò alībawīla, “Mutabogohage a bataale ba selekali ya Bakalidayo; igashagi dūhū ū mu sī yenīyī mulembeele muntūmamīle ū ntemi wa Babuloni, ī mihayo īkūmugololokela.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ishimaeli ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Nesania, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Elishama, walī munhū wa būbyīle wa ng'wikūlū. Na lūūlū kwimanīla ū mu ng'weji gwa mpungatī wiza na banhū bangī ikūmi, būmūlaga ū Gedalia, na a banhū ba Yuda, na a Bakalidayo abo baalī hamò nang'hwe ī Misipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo gwenūyo aho gwaja gīko, pye a banhū bataale na bado, hamò na a bashilikale abo baalīho, būpeelela Misili kūlwa nguno ya kūbogoha Bakalidayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yehoyachini kwinhwa wiyaabī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Yuda ū Yehoyachini aho washisha myaka makūmi adatū na mpungatī alī mu būtungwa, Evi-melodaki ūbiza ntemi wa Babuloni. Mu lūshikū lwa makūmi abīlī na mpungatī ng'weji gw'ikūmi n'ībīlī, ū ntemi ng'wenūyo ūntaligūlīla ū Yehoyachini, ūng'wīnja ū mu jeela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyūlūngalūnga nang'hwe nhambū jawiza; ūngūngūhya, nī lisumbī lya kwigaasīja ūng'winha ly'ikūjo kūtinda a batemi a bangī abo baalī baatungwa Babuloni hamò nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūfuma ikanza lyenīlo ū Yehoyachini ūlekana nasho ī shizwalo sha nyatungwa; nīyo ī shilīwa ūyūlīīla ha meza ya ntemi būlī lūshikū pyī ī shikū ja būpanga bokwe ūbo būkasaaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hangī ū ntemi ūlagīja gīkī ū Yehoyachini ayūpandīka shiigunaanīlo būlī lūshikū, ū mu shikū jose ja būlamu wakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
